{"id":"word:hebrew:H7568","type":"word","title":"רֶשֶׁת","subtitle":"H7568 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a net (as catching animals)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to רֶשֶׁת (H7568) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 22 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"רֶשֶׁת (resheth) means a net (as catching animals) First listed occurrence: Exod 27 4."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"רֶשֶׁת","transliteration":"resheth","pronunciation":"reh'-sheth","strong":"H7568","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7568","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["רִשְׁתִּ֔/י","רֶ֣שֶׁת","רֶ֤שֶׁת","מֵ/רֶ֣שֶׁת","הָ/רֶ֗שֶׁת"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",4],["HR/Ncfsa",4],["HNcfsa",4],["HTd/Ncfsa",3],["HNcfsc",2],["HNcfsc/Sp3mp",2],["HC/Ncfsc",1],["HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1],["HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a net (as catching animals)","usage":"net(-work).","full":"H7568. resheth רֶ֫שֶׁת noun feminine Exod 27:5 net ; — absolute רֶשֶׁת Hosea 5:1 11 t.; רָ֑שֶׁת Prov 1:17 ; construct רֶשֶׁת Exod 27:4 ; 38:4 ; suffix רִשְׁתִּי Hosea 7:12 2 t.; רִשְׁתּוֺ Psa 10:9 ; 35:8 ; רִשְׁתָּם Ezek 19:8 ; Psa 35:7 ; &#8212; 1 net: a. for catching (birds, etc.) הָרָ֑שֶׁת מְזֹרָה חִנָּם Prov 1:17 to no purpose is the net spread in the eyes of any bird; elsewhere figurative (1) of judgment of ׳י , all with פרשׁ : Hosea 7:12 (|| אוֺרִידֵם הַשָּׁמַיִם כְּעוֺף ), Ezek 12:13 ; 17:20 (both || מְצוּדָתִי ), 32:3 (of ׳י catching Pharaoh, under figure of sea-monster; || II. חֵרֶם ); (2) of nations capturing king of Israel under figure of lion 19:8 (with פרשׁ ; || שַׁחְתָּם ); (3) of priests and rulers (as entangling people in sin) Hosea 5:1 (|| מַּח ). b. spread for feet of man (figurative): (1) by ׳י Lam 1:13 (with מָּרַשׁ ); (2) by wicked (= plot ) Prov 29:5 (with פרשׁ ), Psa 140:6 (c. id. ; || מַּךְ טָמַן ), 10:9 ; 25:15 , בְּרַגְלָיו בְּדֶשֶׁת שֻׁלַּח Job 18:8 (|| שְׂבָכָה ); elsewhere with טמן Psa 9:16 (|| שַׁחַת ), 31:5 ; 35:7 ( רִשְׁתָּם שַׁחַת ), 31:8 ; with הֵכִין 57:7 (|| שִׁיחָה ). 2 brazen network for altar of tabernacle הָרֶשֶׁת Exod 27:4-5 , ר מַעֲשֵׂה ׳מִכְבָּר נְחשֶׁת 27:4 = 38:4 (all P). — On Infinitive רֶשֶׁת , see ירשׁ above רֶ֫שֶׁת net , see ירשׁ .","rootNote":"from 3423 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Exod 27 4","keyReferences":["Exod 27 4","Exod 27 4","Exod 27 5","Exod 38 4","Ezek 12 13","Ezek 17 20","Ezek 19 8","Ezek 32 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":22,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Exod 27 4","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רֶ֣שֶׁת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 27 4","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/רֶ֗שֶׁת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 27 5","book":"Exod","chapter":27,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/רֶ֔שֶׁת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Exod 38 4","book":"Exod","chapter":38,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רֶ֣שֶׁת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 12 13","book":"Ezek","chapter":12,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רִשְׁתִּ/י֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Ezek 17 20","book":"Ezek","chapter":17,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רִשְׁתִּ֔/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Ezek 19 8","book":"Ezek","chapter":19,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רִשְׁתָּ֖/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Ezek 32 3","book":"Ezek","chapter":32,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רִשְׁתִּ֔/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"Hos 5 1","book":"Hos","chapter":5,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/רֶ֖שֶׁת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"Hos 7 12","book":"Hos","chapter":7,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord"